{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_092_beit-title\">BEiT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">BEiT 的辨识点是预测外部 tokenizer 产生的离散视觉码，而非 MAE 式像素重建或普通对比学习。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Pretrains Vision Transformers via BERT-style Masked Image Modeling by predicting discrete visual tokens generated by an external dVAE tokenizer.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">原始图像，以及对其 patch 随机遮挡后的 token 序列</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Raw image (for dVAE tokenizer) + block-wise masked patch sequence (for ViT encoder)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">被遮挡位置的离散视觉 token 分布；微调时复用 Transformer 图像表示</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Categorical distribution over discrete visual codes at masked positions; transferable ViT backbone</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=p-BhZSz59o4\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_092_beit')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_092_beit')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"BEiT original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/840392d7e8a5a0a66d0c.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_092_beit\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_092_beit')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_092_beit\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">原始图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">同一图像同时产生学生输入和离散监督目标</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests raw image (for dvae tokenizer) + block-wise masked patch sequence (for vit encoder) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"同一图像同时产生学生输入和离散监督目标\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests raw image (for dvae tokenizer) + block-wise masked patch sequence (for vit encoder) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"原始图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">原始图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同一图像同时产生学生输入和离散监督目标</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests raw image (for dvae tokenizer) + block-wise masked patch sequence (for vit encoder) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练 dVAE 将图像 patch 映射为视觉词表索引，训练 BEiT 时固定\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes discrete tokenizer to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"离散视觉 tokenizer\" data-node-name-en=\"discrete tokenizer\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">离散视觉 tokenizer</span><span class=\"lang-en\">discrete tokenizer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练 dVAE 将图像 patch 映射为视觉词表索引，训练 BEiT 时固定</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes discrete tokenizer to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"图像切块并用可学习 mask token 替换随机位置\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch embedding mask within the core discrete visual token mim computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Patch embedding 与 mask\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch embedding mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Patch embedding 与 mask</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Patch embedding mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像切块并用可学习 mask token 替换随机位置</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch embedding mask within the core discrete visual token mim computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对可见 patch 与 mask token 做全局上下文建模\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs BEiT Transformer encoder within the core discrete visual token mim computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"BEiT Transformer encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"BEiT Transformer encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>BEiT Transformer encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对可见 patch 与 mask token 做全局上下文建模</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs BEiT Transformer encoder within the core discrete visual token mim computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"仅在被遮挡位置预测视觉词表概率\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Masked-token head within the core discrete visual token mim computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Masked-token head\" data-node-name-en=\"Masked-token head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Masked-token head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">仅在被遮挡位置预测视觉词表概率</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Masked-token head within the core discrete visual token mim computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预测分布与 tokenizer 给出的码索引对齐\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies discrete token to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"离散 token 交叉熵\" data-node-name-en=\"discrete token\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">离散 token 交叉熵</span><span class=\"lang-en\">discrete token</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预测分布与 tokenizer 给出的码索引对齐</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies discrete token to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"丢弃预测头后供分类、检测或分割微调\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces categorical distribution over discrete visual codes at masked positions; transferable vit backbone via pretraining.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"预训练视觉表示\" data-node-name-en=\"pretraining\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_092_beit', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预训练视觉表示</span><span class=\"lang-en\">pretraining</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">丢弃预测头后供分类、检测或分割微调</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces categorical distribution over discrete visual codes at masked positions; transferable vit backbone via pretraining.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"BEiT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 离散视觉词的掩码预测目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Masked Patch Prediction Over Discrete Visual Codebook Tokens</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"BEiT：核心公式 · 离散视觉词的掩码预测目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"92\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"23.766004pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.00913 143.040336 23.766004\" width=\"143.040336pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m092_g7-0\"></path><path d=\"M3.506851-.057964V-.420242H2.130194C1.478094-.420242 .840485-.956414 .753538-1.68097H3.383676V-2.043248H.753538C.833239-2.731576 1.405639-3.303975 2.130194-3.303975H3.506851V-3.666253H2.159177C1.152044-3.666253 .376769-2.825768 .376769-1.862109S1.152044-.057964 2.159177-.057964H3.506851Z\" id=\"m092_g7-50\"></path><path d=\"M5.376205-.485452L5.339977-.557908C5.028418-.217367 4.571948 0 4.108232 0C3.318466 0 2.557682-.239103 1.804144-.434734C2.59391-1.137553 3.043135-1.934564 3.217028-2.977925C3.303975-3.521342 3.383676-4.753087 4.14446-4.753087C4.463265-4.753087 4.738596-4.637158 4.738596-4.27488C4.738596-4.129969 4.66614-3.992303 4.564702-3.890865V-3.811164C4.738596-3.869129 5.30375-4.129969 5.30375-4.34009C5.30375-4.803806 4.702368-4.99219 4.325599-4.99219C2.347561-4.99219 2.470736-2.941697 2.086721-1.557795C2.021511-1.311446 1.68097-.543417 1.383902-.543417C1.181026-.543417 .985396-.623118 .78252-.623118C.514435-.623118 .152157-.094192 .050719 .123175L.