"></use><use x=\"-52.263416\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g20-77\" y=\"-55.950221\"></use><use x=\"-42.532508\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g1-61\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"-33.42894\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g10-0\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"-23.962596\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g4-213\" y=\"-67.638856\"></use><use x=\"-25.432304\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g13-56\" y=\"-45.561931\"></use><use x=\"-22.374128\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g7-50\" y=\"-45.561931\"></use><use x=\"-17.603231\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g7-77\" y=\"-45.561931\"></use><use x=\"-7.651935\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g23-108\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"-4.882322\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g23-111\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\".098998\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g23-103\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"7.46799\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g16-63\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"13.538726\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g13-92\" y=\"-55.950221\"></use><use x=\"19.113864\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g4-16\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"23.098905\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g16-73\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"27.273248\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g20-100\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"30.909613\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g20-86\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"35.251428\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g20-65\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"40.50234\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g20-69\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"27.273248\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g13-56\" y=\"-54.640283\"></use><use x=\"48.609928\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g10-106\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"53.768292\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g16-71\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"58.490583\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g7-110\" y=\"-55.813967\"></use><use x=\"62.272406\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g7-77\" y=\"-55.813967\"></use><use x=\"71.260681\" xlink:href=\"#m092_g4-17\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">监督预训练依赖标签，早期图像 SSL 难直接复用 BERT 的 masked objective</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Directly regressing raw RGB pixel values in BERT-style masked pretraining wasted model capacity on high-frequency local noise.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把图像 patch 映射为离散视觉 token，随机遮挡后预测 tokenizer 码</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Quantize image patches into discrete visual tokens via a discrete VAE, then train a ViT to predict the hidden token IDs of masked patches.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以离散 VAE token 作为视觉词表实现 masked image modeling</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Decouples continuous pixel array into a continuous patch embedding input view and a discrete semantic token target view.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">启发 HeartBEiT 与医学 ViT 的 masked image modeling 预训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Directly inspired HeartBEiT (12-lead ECG) and LaBraM (neural VQ tokenizer for EEG) biomedical foundation pretraining.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">MIM 关键里程碑；tokenizer 偏差和预训练数据覆盖仍决定上限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pioneering MIM milestone; offline tokenizer training is often simplified by MAE pixel regression or iBOT online teachers.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把图像 patch 当作视觉词元，学习类似 BERT 的双向上下文。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">监督目标来自独立离散 tokenizer，不是直接回归像素。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">损失只计算被遮挡位置，预训练后保留 encoder 做下游迁移。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Quantize image patches into discrete visual tokens via a discrete VAE, then train a ViT to predict the hidden token IDs of masked patches.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Decouples continuous pixel array into a continuous patch embedding input view and a discrete semantic token target view.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Masked Patch Prediction Over Discrete Visual Codebook Tokens.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可在大量无标注 CT、MRI、病理 patch 上学习上下文表示，再接医学任务头。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">若离散 tokenizer 未在医学域训练，微小病灶与定量灰度可能被量化目标忽略。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Directly inspired HeartBEiT (12-lead ECG) and LaBraM (neural VQ tokenizer for EEG) biomedical foundation pretraining.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Pioneering MIM milestone; offline tokenizer training is often simplified by MAE pixel regression or iBOT online teachers.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/pdf?id=p-BhZSz59o4\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>BEiT: BERT Pre-Training of Image Transformers</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/unilm/tree/master/beit\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
